    "message": "ci(test-slots): publish sha-\u003ccommit\u003e image alias for Glimmung deploy\n\ndocker-build-check additionally imports a commit-addressed `sha-\u003ccommit\u003e` alias\nof the content-fingerprinted app image. Glimmung's deploy-image resolver is\nmoving to look images up by the verified commit SHA directly instead of\nreconstructing a run-scoped ci-pr/ci-ref lookup tag from GitHub Actions metadata\n(romaine-life/glimmung#873). Additive for now; the run-scoped lookup tag is\nremoved in a follow-up once the resolver reads sha-\u003ccommit\u003e.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
